#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:5
#: edad5d6df41647c0bd0afddc6cc3b39f
msgid "TECS (Total Energy Control System) for Speed and Height Tuning Guide"
msgstr "TECS（总能量控制系统）速度与高度调参指南"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:7
#: fc100781327946ad891b9ae71f06af79
msgid ""
"This article explains how to tune the TECs system for speed and height "
"control."
msgstr "本文介绍如何调参TECS系统以控制速度和高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:11
#: 92324b3dfe3f4545b27235117cc93e71
msgid "Calibrate the airspeed sensor"
msgstr "校准空速传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:13
#: 5cdfa669dfa445a8bde8aa12d93af4b8
msgid "This only applies if you are using an airspeed sensor."
msgstr "这仅在使用空速传感器时适用。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:15
#: 33f0ff62354747d6ac173c95545fd2f5
msgid ""
"A properly installed and calibrated airspeed sensor enables your model to "
"fly with much better control over its airspeed, which in turn enables lower "
"speeds to be used safely, extending endurance. For this reason if you are "
"interested in maximising the climb performance and endurance of your "
"aircraft, using an airspeed sensor and setting it up properly is worth the "
"effort. Instructions on how to calibrate an airspeed sensor :ref:`can be "
"found here <calibrating-an-airspeed-sensor>`."
msgstr ""
"安装和校准正确的空速传感器能让飞机以更好的空速控制飞行，进而能够安全地使用较低的速度，延长续航时间。因此，如果您希望最大化飞机的爬升性能和续航时间，使用空速传感器并正确设置是值得的。有关如何校准空速传感器的说明"
" :ref:`可在此处找到 <calibrating-an-airspeed-sensor>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:25
#: ee98c2bfd4ba4d398f0b9690ad729f07
msgid ""
"**Glider Pilots:** Set :ref:`TECS_SPDWEIGHT <tecs-total-energy-control-"
"system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide_tecs_spdweight>` to 2.0, and you can "
"also use an airspeed sensor and take advantage of TECS ability to control "
"your airspeed."
msgstr ""
"**滑翔机飞手：** 将 :ref:`TECS_SPDWEIGHT <tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-"
"speed-height-tuning-guide_tecs_spdweight>` 设置为2.0，您也可以使用空速传感器并利用TECS控制空速的能力。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:30
#: f8883861245149cdbdd39d9b72adda3a
msgid "Tune the Pitch to Servo Loop"
msgstr "调参俯仰到舵机回路"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:32
#: d2a312a9963f4cd6b119b5586a2d9eba
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The performance of the TECS speed and height controller is dependent on "
"having the pitch to servo control loop tuned correctly. Before tuning TECS "
"you need to have tuned the pitch loop following the instructions either in "
":ref:`automatic-tuning-with-autotune` or manually using :ref:`Roll, Pitch "
"and Yaw Controller Tuning <roll-pitch-controller-tuning>`."
msgstr ""
"TECS速度和高度控制器的性能取决于俯仰到舵机控制回路是否调参正确。在调参TECS之前，您需要按照 :ref:`Roll, Pitch and Yaw "
"Controller Tuning <roll-pitch-controller-tuning>` 中的说明调参俯仰回路。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:37
#: 71242a066b1245d4900332a341b9510d
msgid ""
"Set initial parameters — throttle, pitch, airspeed and vertical speed limits"
msgstr "设置初始参数——油门、俯仰、空速和垂直速度限制"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:39
#: 089d275854154fc6a7a4d7163d663286
msgid ""
"If you have a properly calibrated airspeed sensor and a well tuned pitch to "
"servo loop, then the throttle, pitch angle, airspeed and vertical speed "
"limits limits are the final keys to getting the TECS algorithm to perform "
"well."
msgstr "如果您有正确校准的空速传感器和调参良好的俯仰到舵机回路，那么油门、俯仰角、空速和垂直速度限制是使TECS算法良好运行的最终关键。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:44
#: 8e64fd8687314075a06f57d41ecebd54
msgid ""
"if you are not using an airspeed sensor, then skip down to the :ref:`Section"
" below for setting initial parameters without an airspeed sensor<no-"
"airspeed-sensor>`."
msgstr "如果不使用空速传感器，请跳至 :ref:`下面的无空速传感器初始参数设置章节<no-airspeed-sensor>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:46
#: 0010339fe65d4c978e98756e56bea2a4
msgid ""
"The following instructions are based around taking a series of measurements,"
" whilst the plane is being flown at the speed set by :ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE "
"<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>` which represents the speed that you are most likely going"
" to be flying at. Flying these tests at "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>` is impractical unless you have an "
"assistant calling out airspeed, so where these instructions ask for the "
"plane to be flown at :ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE <AIRSPEED_CRUISE>`, fly at a "
"speed in the middle zone between your :ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN <tecs-total-energy-"
"control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide_thr_min>` and "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MAX <tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-"
"tuning-guide_thr_max>` and that will be good enough for most applications. "
"Those users wanting to extract maximum performance can dial the numbers in "
"over a number of flights, using the log data."
msgstr ""
"以下说明基于在飞机以 :ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE <AIRSPEED_CRUISE>` "
"设定的速度飞行时进行一系列测量，该速度代表您最可能飞行的速度。除非有助手报告空速，否则在 "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>` 下进行这些测试并不实际，因此在这些说明要求飞机以 "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE <AIRSPEED_CRUISE>` 飞行时，以 :ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN <tecs-"
"total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide_thr_min>` 和 "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MAX <tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-"
"tuning-guide_thr_max>` "
"之间的中间速度飞行，对于大多数应用已足够。希望获得最佳性能的用户可以通过多次飞行使用日志数据来精确调整数值。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:56
#: 108d7a7fb3bb44bba0ad36ed510e088f
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Set the maximum throttle percentage :ref:`THR_MAX <tecs-total-energy-"
"control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide_thr_max>`. The maximum throttle"
" should be set to a value that enables the aircraft to climb at its maximum "
"pitch angle (default value of 20 degrees) at "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>`. The default value of 75% should be "
"OK for moderately powered aircraft. Low powered aircraft will need to "
"increase it to 100%, high powered models (capable of vertical climbs) will "
"need to reduce it."
msgstr ""
"设置最大油门百分比 :ref:`THR_MAX <tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-"
"tuning-guide_thr_max>`。最大油门应设置为使飞机能够在 "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>` "
"时以最大俯仰角（默认值20度）爬升的值。默认值75%对于中等功率飞机应该合适。低功率飞机需要增加到100%，高功率飞机（能够垂直爬升）需要降低。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:63
#: 15a0eab789d0473080208f37f9cbfd9b
msgid ""
"Set the throttle percentage required to fly level at "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>` by adjusting the :ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE"
" <tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-"
"guide_trim_throttle>` parameter. This can be determined initially by testing"
" different throttle settings in FBWA mode."
msgstr ""
"通过调整 :ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE <tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-"
"tuning-guide_trim_throttle>` 参数，设置在 :ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>` "
"下平飞所需的油门百分比。这可以通过在FBWA模式下测试不同油门设置来初步确定。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:66
#: 30326329a19e4dc0894b43a260e494a1
msgid ""
"Set the maximum and minimum airspeed limits (in metres/second) using the "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MAX<AIRSPEED_MAX>` and :ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN<AIRSPEED_MIN>` "
"parameters. :ref:`AIRSPEED_MAX<AIRSPEED_MAX>` should be set to just slightly"
" less than the maximum speed your aircraft is capable of in level flight "
"with the throttle set to :ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>`. "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN<AIRSPEED_MIN>` should be set to the slowest speed your "
"aircraft can safely fly without stalling in level flight."
msgstr ""
"使用 :ref:`AIRSPEED_MAX<AIRSPEED_MAX>` 和 :ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN<AIRSPEED_MIN>` "
"参数设置最大和最小空速限制（米/秒）。:ref:`AIRSPEED_MAX<AIRSPEED_MAX>` 应设置为略低于飞机在油门设置为 "
":ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>` 时平飞所能达到的最大速度。:ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN<AIRSPEED_MIN>` "
"应设置为飞机在平飞时不失速的最慢安全速度。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:72
#: 088f7062a702444582ada23b14834f56
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Set the maximum pitch angle :ref:`PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG <tecs-total-energy-"
"control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide_lim_pitch_max>` (in degrees) "
"your aircraft can fly with the throttle set to :ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>`. This"
" can be determined by performing maximum pitch angle climbs in FBWA with the"
" throttle set to the maximum and checking the airspeed during climb. If the "
"airspeed rises above :ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>` during the "
"climb, then either increase :ref:`PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG<PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG>` or "
"reduce :ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>`. If it falls below "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN<AIRSPEED_MIN>` during climb then either reduce "
":ref:`PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG<PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG>` or increase "
":ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>`  . Make sure you allow some margin for reduction in "
"power due to reduced battery voltage or other effects. Remember that the "
"amount of power from an electric power system at the end of flight will only"
" be 80% of what you have at the start."
msgstr ""
"设置飞机在油门设置为 :ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>` 时能飞行的最大俯仰角 :ref:`PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG <tecs-"
"total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide_lim_pitch_max>` "
"（度）。可以通过在FBWA模式下以最大油门进行最大俯仰角爬升并检查爬升过程中的空速来确定。如果爬升中空速超过 "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>`，则增大 "
":ref:`PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG<PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG>` 或减小 "
":ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>`。如果在爬升中空速低于 :ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN<AIRSPEED_MIN>`，则减小 "
":ref:`PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG<PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG>` 或增大 "
":ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>`。确保为电池电压下降或其他因素导致的功率降低留有余量。请记住，飞行结束时电动动力系统的功率仅为起始时的80%。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:87
#: 3d71d4c9637645b0ab77355de9cbfdfd
msgid ""
"**Glider Pilots:** If a pure glider (no motor), set "
":ref:`PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG<PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG>` to a value low enough to assure "
"that the glider will not stall if the autopilot demands that pitch angle."
msgstr ""
"**滑翔机飞手：** 如果是纯滑翔机（无电机），将 :ref:`PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG<PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG>` "
"设置为足够低的值，以确保飞控要求该俯仰角时滑翔机不会失速。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:89
#: 4c8afb2ef3d14c31be35f619704914d9
msgid ""
"Set the minimum pitch angle :ref:`PTCH_LIM_MIN_DEG <tecs-total-energy-"
"control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide_lim_pitch_min>` (in degrees) "
"your aircraft can fly with the throttle set to :ref:`THR_MIN <tecs-total-"
"energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide_thr_min>` that can be "
"flown without over-speeding the aircraft."
msgstr ""
"设置飞机在油门设置为 :ref:`THR_MIN <tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-"
"tuning-guide_thr_min>` 时能飞行且不会超速的最小俯仰角 :ref:`PTCH_LIM_MIN_DEG <tecs-total-"
"energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide_lim_pitch_min>` （度）。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:93
#: fce645ec5e174c6db86835977d1c83de
msgid ""
"Set the maximum climb rate :ref:`TECS_CLMB_MAX <tecs-total-energy-control-"
"system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide_tecs_clmb_max>` (in metres/second). "
"This is the best climb rate that the aircraft can achieve with the throttle "
"set to :ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>` and flying at "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>`. For electric aircraft make sure "
"this number can be achieved towards the end of flight when the battery "
"voltage has reduced. This can be measured in FBWA mode by performing climbs "
"to height with the throttle set to :ref:`THR_MAX <THR_MAX>`."
msgstr ""
"设置最大爬升率 :ref:`TECS_CLMB_MAX <tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-"
"height-tuning-guide_tecs_clmb_max>` （米/秒）。这是飞机在油门设置为 :ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>`"
" 并以 :ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>` "
"飞行时能达到的最佳爬升率。对于电动飞机，确保该数值在飞行结束时电池电压降低后仍能达到。可以在FBWA模式下以 :ref:`THR_MAX "
"<THR_MAX>` 油门爬升至高度来测量。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:100
#: d5958378621040d09ad6c74d4cee445e
msgid ""
"Set the minimum sink rate :ref:`TECS_SINK_MIN <tecs-total-energy-control-"
"system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide_tecs_sink_min>` (in metres/second). "
"This is the sink rate of the aircraft with the throttle set to "
":ref:`THR_MIN<THR_MIN>` and flown at "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>`. This can be measured by closing the"
" throttle in FBWA and gliding the aircraft down from height."
msgstr ""
"设置最小下沉率 :ref:`TECS_SINK_MIN <tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-"
"height-tuning-guide_tecs_sink_min>` （米/秒）。这是飞机在油门设置为 :ref:`THR_MIN<THR_MIN>`"
" 并以 :ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>` "
"飞行时的下沉率。可以通过在FBWA模式下关闭油门并从高空滑翔来测量。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:105
#: 511b4b87b393464eb5283f8bdef72c64
msgid ""
"Set the maximum sink rate  :ref:`TECS_SINK_MAX <tecs-total-energy-control-"
"system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide_tecs_sink_max>` (in metres/second). If "
"this value is too large, the aircraft can over-speed on descent. This should"
" be set to a value that can be achieved without exceeding the lower pitch "
"angle limit and without exceeding :ref:`AIRSPEED_MAX<AIRSPEED_MAX>`."
msgstr ""
"设置最大下沉率 :ref:`TECS_SINK_MAX <tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-"
"height-tuning-guide_tecs_sink_max>` "
"（米/秒）。如果该值过大，飞机在下降时可能会超速。应设置为不超过最低俯仰角限制且不超过 "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MAX<AIRSPEED_MAX>` 的可达值。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:114
#: ace6f52617f84dc2bbb5e8fd5cc9ce0b
msgid "Set initial parameters - when no airspeed sensor is used"
msgstr "设置初始参数——不使用空速传感器时"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:116
#: 85e091537ac845eba77eb25e76294b17
msgid "Using a GCS and assistant, or flight logs:"
msgstr "使用GCS和助手，或飞行日志："

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:118
#: 87ec9570c1714d458806370dd7794d85
msgid ""
"Setup the desired cruising speed and throttle in FBWA. This can be adjusted "
"using the :ref:`PTCH_TRIM_DEG<PTCH_TRIM_DEG>` parameter to get level flight "
"at the desired throttle level. If cruising speed is too great, lower "
"throttle and increase :ref:`PTCH_TRIM_DEG<PTCH_TRIM_DEG>` until altitude is "
"constant, or vice-a-versa. Set the :ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>` to "
"that throttle value."
msgstr ""
"在FBWA模式下设置所需的巡航速度和油门。可以通过调整 :ref:`PTCH_TRIM_DEG<PTCH_TRIM_DEG>` "
"参数在所需油门水平下实现平飞。如果巡航速度过快，降低油门并增加 :ref:`PTCH_TRIM_DEG<PTCH_TRIM_DEG>` "
"直到高度恒定，反之亦然。将 :ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>` 设置为该油门值。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:119
#: 9eba9d6eb05b4d67a0df51c3646cfdb8
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"In FBWA, do a full throttle full back stick climb (you can also lower this "
"throttle value with :ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>` if full throttle seems "
"excessive). Set :ref:`PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG<PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG>` such that you "
"maintain close to the cruising speed, or at least not less than a safe "
"flying speed.  Note the steady state climb rate, and set "
":ref:`TECS_CLMB_MAX<TECS_CLMB_MAX>` to 80% of that value for margin at low "
"battery. You can set lower pilot demanded climb rates with "
":ref:`FBWB_CLIMB_RATE<FBWB_CLIMB_RATE>`, but you want TECS to have the "
"maximum capability of you aircraft for sudden altitude demand changes, like "
"switching to RTL, to maximize its climbing ability in order to get out of "
"bad situations."
msgstr ""
"在FBWA模式下，进行全油门、全后仰杆爬升（如果全油门感觉过大，也可以用 :ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>` 降低该油门值）。设置 "
":ref:`PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG<PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG>` 使空速接近巡航速度，或至少不低于安全飞行速度。记录稳态爬升率，将 "
":ref:`TECS_CLMB_MAX<TECS_CLMB_MAX>` 设置为该值的80%以在低电量时留有余量。可以用 "
":ref:`FBWB_CLIMB_RATE<FBWB_CLIMB_RATE>` "
"设置较低的飞手要求爬升率，但希望TECS具备飞机的最大爬升能力以应对突然的高度需求变化（如切换到RTL），以最大化爬升能力脱离险境。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:120
#: 3c40338574264e028a630426d57a1529
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`TECS_PITCH_MAX<TECS_PITCH_MAX>` to "
":ref:`PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG<PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG>`."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`TECS_PITCH_MAX<TECS_PITCH_MAX>` 设置为 "
":ref:`PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG<PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:121
#: 311bcbdebff440f9b32f2443d02955ee
msgid ""
"Now idle the throttle while sticks are centered and establish the  descent "
"rate. Set :ref:`TECS_SINK_MIN<TECS_SINK_MIN>` to that rate."
msgstr "现在在摇杆居中时收油门，建立下降率。将 :ref:`TECS_SINK_MIN<TECS_SINK_MIN>` 设置为该速率。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:122
#: 225256efe8974ba380f9342b131c6845
msgid ""
"Using idle throttle, push full down elevator and establish this new sink "
"rate. If the aircraft overspeeds, set the  "
":ref:`PTCH_LIM_MIN_DEG<PTCH_LIM_MIN_DEG>` to a higher value. Set "
":ref:`TECS_SINK_MAX<TECS_SINK_MAX>` to that maximum sink rate."
msgstr ""
"使用怠速油门，推全下仰升降舵并建立新的下沉率。如果飞机超速，将 :ref:`PTCH_LIM_MIN_DEG<PTCH_LIM_MIN_DEG>` "
"设置为更大的值。将 :ref:`TECS_SINK_MAX<TECS_SINK_MAX>` 设置为该最大下沉率。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:124
#: e1868291b4f748d78e23e546b641dbc3
msgid ""
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN<AIRSPEED_MIN>`, :ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>`, "
"and :ref:`AIRSPEED_MAX<AIRSPEED_MAX>` are not used when no airspeed sensor "
"is present (unless :ref:`TECS_SYNAIRSPEED<TECS_SYNAIRSPEED>` is enabled, "
"which is usually not recommended since the synthetic airspeed estimate can "
"be very wrong on occasion. However, :ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN<AIRSPEED_MIN>` and "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MAX<AIRSPEED_MAX>` should be set to the normal minimum and "
"maximum flying speeds in order for :ref:`AUTOTUNE <automatic-tuning-with-"
"autotune>` and :ref:`STALL PREVENTION <stall-prevention>` features to work "
"properly."
msgstr ""
"当没有空速传感器时（除非启用了 "
":ref:`TECS_SYNAIRSPEED<TECS_SYNAIRSPEED>`，通常不推荐，因为合成空速估计偶尔可能非常不准确），不使用 "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN<AIRSPEED_MIN>`、:ref:`AIRSPEED_CRUISE<AIRSPEED_CRUISE>` 和 "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MAX<AIRSPEED_MAX>`。但是，:ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN<AIRSPEED_MIN>` 和 "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MAX<AIRSPEED_MAX>` 应设置为正常最小和最大飞行速度，以使 :ref:`AUTOTUNE "
"<automatic-tuning-with-autotune>` 和 :ref:`失速防护 <stall-prevention>` 功能正常工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:127
#: f3713a8d633d4207918ba944ca82abb2
msgid "Flight Testing"
msgstr "飞行测试"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:129
#: bcb025a3d6de43b0af58a9abe6a9c470
msgid ""
"Place the aircraft into a loiter about a waypoint either using auto, RTL or "
"guided mode. Check that the aircraft maintains height without noticeable "
"pitching or height changes greater than 10m. If the aircraft appears to be "
"oscillating in height then try increasing :ref:`TECS_TIME_CONST <tecs-total-"
"energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide_tecs_time_const>` in "
"increments of 1 (do not increase to more than 10). If you need to increase "
"to more than 10 to reduce the oscillation in height, then this normally "
"indicates a problem with the pitch to servo loop tuning or the settings of "
"the pitch angle and climb rate limits."
msgstr ""
"使用Auto、RTL或Guided模式，将飞机置于围绕航点的盘旋中。检查飞机是否在不出现明显俯仰或超过10米高度变化的情况下保持高度。如果飞机出现高度振荡，尝试以1为步长增加"
" :ref:`TECS_TIME_CONST <tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-"
"tuning-guide_tecs_time_const>` "
"（不要超过10）。如果需要增加到超过10才能减少高度振荡，通常表明俯仰到舵机回路调参有问题，或者俯仰角和爬升率限制设置有问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:139
#: 4b58468940fb4373bb467863dac7b6c7
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Verify that :ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>`, "
":ref:`PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG<PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG>` and "
":ref:`TECS_CLMB_MAX<TECS_CLMB_MAX>` are set correctly. The setting of these "
"parameters can be checked by commanding a positive altitude change of no "
"less than 50m in loiter, RTL or guided mode. The objective is to set these "
"parameters such that the throttle required to climb is about 80% of "
":ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>`, the aircraft is maintaining airspeed, and the "
"demanded pitch angle is about 5 degrees below "
":ref:`PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG<PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG>`."
msgstr ""
"验证 :ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>`、:ref:`PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG<PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG>` 和 "
":ref:`TECS_CLMB_MAX<TECS_CLMB_MAX>` "
"设置是否正确。可以通过在Loiter、RTL或Guided模式下指令不少于50米的正高度变化来检查这些参数的设置。目标是设置这些参数，使爬升所需油门约为"
" :ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>` 的80%，飞机保持空速，所需俯仰角约低于 "
":ref:`PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG<PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG>` 5度。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:147
#: ddb4091657ab42f8b203dc81f8c3fe9a
msgid ""
"If speed drops below the desired value, and the throttle increases to and "
"stays on :ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>`, then either "
":ref:`TECS_CLMB_MAX<TECS_CLMB_MAX>` should be reduced or "
":ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>` increased."
msgstr ""
"如果速度降至所需值以下，而油门增加并保持在 :ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>`，则应减小 "
":ref:`TECS_CLMB_MAX<TECS_CLMB_MAX>` 或增大 :ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:150
#: f9019ca1a41e4f668a83caee15e35110
msgid ""
"If the demanded pitch angle is constantly at the limit set by "
":ref:`PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG<PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG>`, then either the pitch angle limit"
" :ref:`PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG<PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG>` needs to be increased or the "
"maximum climb rate :ref:`TECS_CLMB_MAX<TECS_CLMB_MAX>` needs to be reduced."
msgstr ""
"如果所需俯仰角持续处于 :ref:`PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG<PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG>` 限制，则需要增大俯仰角限制 "
":ref:`PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG<PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG>` 或减小最大爬升率 "
":ref:`TECS_CLMB_MAX<TECS_CLMB_MAX>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:155
#: e32addfba03544be80322c3f689614a7
msgid ""
"Verify :ref:`PTCH_LIM_MIN_DEG<PTCH_LIM_MIN_DEG>` and "
":ref:`TECS_SINK_MAX<TECS_SINK_MAX>` are set correctly. The setting of these "
"parameters can be checked by commanding a negative altitude change of no "
"less than 50m in loiter, RTL or guided mode. The objective is to set these "
"parameters such that the throttle is on :ref:`THR_MIN<THR_MIN>`, the "
"airspeed is below :ref:`AIRSPEED_MAX<AIRSPEED_MAX>` (or visually confirm "
"that model is not gaining too much speed if an airspeed sensor is not being "
"used), and the demanded pitch angle is about 5 degrees above "
":ref:`PTCH_LIM_MIN_DEG<PTCH_LIM_MIN_DEG>`."
msgstr ""
"验证 :ref:`PTCH_LIM_MIN_DEG<PTCH_LIM_MIN_DEG>` 和 "
":ref:`TECS_SINK_MAX<TECS_SINK_MAX>` "
"设置是否正确。可以通过在Loiter、RTL或Guided模式下指令不少于50米的负高度变化来检查。目标是设置这些参数，使油门处于 "
":ref:`THR_MIN<THR_MIN>`，空速低于 :ref:`AIRSPEED_MAX<AIRSPEED_MAX>` "
"（或如果不使用空速传感器则目视确认飞机速度未增加太多），所需俯仰角约高于 "
":ref:`PTCH_LIM_MIN_DEG<PTCH_LIM_MIN_DEG>` 5度。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:164
#: 70ae754c9aa741399032977ee357d9fa
msgid ""
"If the speed is too high, then :ref:`TECS_SINK_MAX<TECS_SINK_MAX>` should be"
" reduced."
msgstr "如果速度过高，则应减小 :ref:`TECS_SINK_MAX<TECS_SINK_MAX>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:165
#: 470cb9b3569a4dcba14f6851dc8210b2
msgid ""
"If the demanded pitch angle is constantly at the limit set by "
":ref:`PTCH_LIM_MIN_DEG<PTCH_LIM_MIN_DEG>`, then either the pitch angle limit"
" :ref:`PTCH_LIM_MIN_DEG<PTCH_LIM_MIN_DEG>` needs to be reduced (become more "
"negative) or the maximum sink rate :ref:`TECS_SINK_MAX<TECS_SINK_MAX>` needs"
" to be reduced."
msgstr ""
"如果所需俯仰角持续处于 :ref:`PTCH_LIM_MIN_DEG<PTCH_LIM_MIN_DEG>` 限制，则需要减小（变得更负）俯仰角限制 "
":ref:`PTCH_LIM_MIN_DEG<PTCH_LIM_MIN_DEG>` 或减小最大下沉率 "
":ref:`TECS_SINK_MAX<TECS_SINK_MAX>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:170
#: 823a3e624227490f9dde796d9da46f90
msgid ""
"If the height response oscillates you can try increasing the value of "
":ref:`TECS_PTCH_DAMP <TECS_PTCH_DAMP>` in increments of 0.1 (don't go above "
"0.5 unless you know how to check for excessive noise in the nav_pitch signal"
" using the mission planner tuning window) and then try increasing the value "
"of :ref:`TECS_TIME_CONST<TECS_TIME_CONST>` in increments of 1.0."
msgstr ""
"如果高度响应振荡，可以尝试以0.1为步长增加 :ref:`TECS_PTCH_DAMP <TECS_PTCH_DAMP>` "
"的值（除非您知道如何使用Mission Planner调参窗口检查nav_pitch信号中的过大噪声，否则不要超过0.5），然后尝试以1.0为步长增加 "
":ref:`TECS_TIME_CONST<TECS_TIME_CONST>` 的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:178
#: 73cc8bffe3ee4ff4af58faeafafa00c0
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If you are not using an airspeed sensor and you have problems with pitch and"
" height oscillation using the default parameters, then it usually indicates "
"that your pitch to servo loop has not been tuned properly or your model "
"could have a significant thrust line misalignment where throttle changes "
"cause noticeable pitch angle changes. You should make sure your pitch loop "
"tuning is adequate, before adjusting :ref:`TECS_PTCH_DAMP<TECS_PTCH_DAMP>` "
"and :ref:`TECS_TIME_CONST<TECS_TIME_CONST>` as described above."
msgstr ""
"如果不使用空速传感器，并且在使用默认参数时出现俯仰和高度振荡问题，通常表明俯仰到舵机回路调参不正确，或者飞机可能存在显著的推力线不对齐，导致油门变化时出现明显的俯仰角变化。理想情况下，应先改善俯仰回路调参，再调整"
" :ref:`TECS_PTCH_DAMP<TECS_PTCH_DAMP>` 和 "
":ref:`TECS_TIME_CONST<TECS_TIME_CONST>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:186
#: 14e1bae4f7f64dee902f798916dde470
msgid ""
"If using airspeed sensing, adjust the value of "
":ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>` so that it matches the average amount of"
" throttle required by the controller during constant height loiter. If not "
"using airspeed sensing, adjust :ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>` to "
"achieve a level flight speed you are happy with."
msgstr ""
"如果使用空速传感器，调整 :ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>` "
"的值，使其与控制器在恒定高度盘旋时所需的平均油门量相匹配。如果不使用空速传感器，调整 "
":ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE<TRIM_THROTTLE>` 以达到您满意的平飞速度。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:194
#: b8f8497c099648e49a15c45c7decb1d2
msgid "Fine Tuning"
msgstr "精细调参"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:196
#: 9886c4a190f44ecf8d604de967375a13
msgid ""
"The following parameters can be adjusted to fine-tune the controller "
"response:"
msgstr "以下参数可用于精细调整控制器响应："

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:201
#: b301fde22c7d429ba3d7f30552441429
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
":ref:`THR_SLEWRATE <THR_SLEWRATE>`: This is the maximum % change in throttle"
" over one second . A setting of 100 means to not change the throttle by more"
" than 100% of the full throttle range in one second. Reducing this value "
"will reduce the amount of throttle 'surging' in windy conditions but will "
"reduce controller accuracy and will produce oscillation in throttle, speed "
"and height if reduced too much."
msgstr ""
":ref:`THR_SLEWRATE "
"<THR_SLEWRATE>`：这是一秒内油门变化的最大百分比。设置为100意味着在一秒内油门不会超过全油门范围的100%。降低该值将减少大风条件下油门「冲击」量，但会降低控制精度，如果降低过多会导致油门、速度和高度出现振荡。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:212
#: 6d6e9f1b6f8e48cfba84e9402c7020f8
msgid ""
":ref:`TECS_THR_DAMP <TECS_THR_DAMP>`: This is the damping gain for the "
"throttle demand loop. Increase to add damping to correct for oscillations in"
" speed and height. **This gain has no effect if an airspeed sensor is not "
"being used.**"
msgstr ""
":ref:`TECS_THR_DAMP "
"<TECS_THR_DAMP>`：这是油门需求回路的阻尼增益。增大可增加阻尼以纠正速度和高度振荡。**如果不使用空速传感器，此增益无效。**"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:220
#: 41a68916741343068499a3d6bfa5c847
msgid ""
":ref:`TECS_INTEG_GAIN <TECS_INTEG_GAIN>`: This is the integrator gain on the"
" control loop. Increasing this gain increases the speed at which speed and "
"height offsets are trimmed out, but reduces damping and increases overshoot."
msgstr ""
":ref:`TECS_INTEG_GAIN "
"<TECS_INTEG_GAIN>`：这是控制回路上的积分器增益。增大此增益会加快消除速度和高度偏移的速度，但会降低阻尼并增加超调量。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:226
#: 3376d05604bd456c8afe09c83310e4fa
msgid ""
":ref:`TECS_RLL2THR <TECS_RLL2THR>`: Increasing this gain turn increases the "
"amount of throttle that will be used to compensate for the additional drag "
"created by turning. Ideally this should be set to approximately 10 x the "
"extra sink rate in m/s created by a 45 degree bank turn. Increase this gain "
"if the aircraft initially loses energy in turns and reduce if the aircraft "
"initially gains energy in turns. Efficient high aspect-ratio aircraft (eg "
"powered sailplanes) can use a lower value, whereas inefficient low aspect-"
"ratio models (eg delta wings) can use a higher value. **This gain has no "
"effect if an airspeed sensor is not being used.**"
msgstr ""
":ref:`TECS_RLL2THR "
"<TECS_RLL2THR>`：增大此增益会增加用于补偿转弯产生的额外阻力的油门量。理想情况下，应设置为约45度倾斜转弯产生的额外下沉率（米/秒）的10倍。如果飞机在转弯时初始损失能量则增大此增益，如果初始获得能量则减小。高效高展弦比飞机（如动力滑翔机）可使用较低值，而低效低展弦比飞机（如三角翼）可使用较高值。**如果不使用空速传感器，此增益无效。**"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:240
#: f5fe6ead935f4290a12a63185e0b7ba6
msgid ""
":ref:`TECS_SPDWEIGHT <TECS_SPDWEIGHT>`: This parameter adjusts the amount of"
" weighting that the pitch control applies to speed vs height errors. Setting"
" it to 0.0 will cause the pitch control to control height and ignore speed "
"errors. This will normally improve height accuracy but give larger airspeed "
"errors. Setting it to 2.0 will cause the pitch control loop to control speed"
" and ignore height errors. This will normally reduce airspeed errors, but "
"give larger height errors. The default value of 1.0 allows the pitch control"
" to simultaneously control height and speed."
msgstr ""
":ref:`TECS_SPDWEIGHT "
"<TECS_SPDWEIGHT>`：此参数调整俯仰控制对速度误差与高度误差的权重比。设置为0.0将使俯仰控制仅控制高度并忽略速度误差，通常会提高高度精度但产生较大空速误差。设置为2.0将使俯仰控制回路仅控制速度并忽略高度误差，通常会减少空速误差但产生较大高度误差。默认值1.0允许俯仰控制同时控制高度和速度。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:252
#: a2adc3b1441b4caf9dda5e36f7a61131
msgid ""
"This parameter is has no effect if the TECS has no airspeed estimate, in "
"which case a value of 0.0 will be used. To provide an airspeed estimate an "
"airspeed sensor must be installed, or :ref:`TECS_SYNAIRSPEED "
"<TECS_SYNAIRSPEED>` must be set to 1."
msgstr ""
"如果TECS没有空速估计，此参数无效，此时将使用0.0的值。要提供空速估计，必须安装空速传感器，或将 :ref:`TECS_SYNAIRSPEED "
"<TECS_SYNAIRSPEED>` 设置为1。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:259
#: 28989d959dd149e88b2558ff6e28df71
msgid ""
"**Glider Pilots**: Set this parameter to 2.0 (The glider will adjust its "
"pitch angle to maintain airspeed, ignoring changes in height)."
msgstr "**滑翔机飞手**：将此参数设置为2.0（滑翔机将调整俯仰角以保持空速，忽略高度变化）。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:264
#: 13423342e4da4b508b919d7076bf65a2
msgid ""
"When the :ref:`soaring<soaring>` feature is in use and is requesting the "
"TECS shut off throttle to glide, a value of 2.0 will automatically be used "
"providing an airspeed estimate is available."
msgstr "当 :ref:`soaring<soaring>` 功能正在使用并请求TECS关闭油门以滑翔时，如果有空速估计可用，将自动使用2.0的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:268
#: 54a1e699c31e43de992784cf340b9ada
msgid ""
":ref:`TECS_PTCH_FF_K <TECS_PTCH_FF_K>`: This parameter can be used together "
"with :ref:`TECS_PTCH_FF_V0<TECS_PTCH_FF_V0>` to provide a feedforward gain "
"between demanded airspeed and pitch attitude. This is best used with "
":ref:`TECS_SPDWEIGHT<TECS_SPDWEIGHT>` set to 2.0. As noted above, this is "
"appropriate for gliders, and setting :ref:`TECS_PTCH_FF_K <TECS_PTCH_FF_K>` "
"can improve the responsiveness to changes in speed demand."
msgstr ""
":ref:`TECS_PTCH_FF_K <TECS_PTCH_FF_K>`：此参数可与 "
":ref:`TECS_PTCH_FF_V0<TECS_PTCH_FF_V0>` 配合使用，在需求空速和俯仰姿态之间提供前馈增益。最好与 "
":ref:`TECS_SPDWEIGHT<TECS_SPDWEIGHT>` 设置为2.0一起使用。如上所述，这适用于滑翔机，设置 "
":ref:`TECS_PTCH_FF_K <TECS_PTCH_FF_K>` 可以提高对速度需求变化的响应性。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:277
#: db777e24d79d46e7b54d202ff7f85cf7
msgid ""
"The units of this parameter are radians of pitch per metre per second "
"between current demanded airspeed and TECS_PTCH_FF_V0. Appropriate values "
"are negative (pitch down with increasing speed demand). Sensible starting "
"values are -0.04 for gliders and -0.08 for draggy airframes."
msgstr ""
"此参数的单位是弧度俯仰每米每秒（当前需求空速与TECS_PTCH_FF_V0之间的差值）。适当的值为负值（随速度需求增加而低头）。滑翔机的合理起始值为-0.04，阻力较大机身为-0.08。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:282
#: fffe342c5203486488195831cca7440d
msgid ""
"To tune this parameter, either use FBWB to manually input speed demand "
"changes, or set up a mission involving DO_CHANGE_SPEED items. Set "
"TECS_PTCH_FF_V0 to the normal flight speed of your aircraft. This should "
"also be the speed it glides at with no pitch input in FBWA mode (i.e. when "
"flying at a pitch attitude specified by the "
":ref:`STAB_PITCH_DOWN<STAB_PITCH_DOWN>` parameter). When reviewing the log "
"from such a flight, look at the TECS pitch integrator item (TECS.iph) in the"
" onboard logs. Usually this reduces (becomes more negative) to trim the "
"aircraft nose-down for a higher airspeed, and vice versa. The goal is to use"
" the feed-forward gain to reduce the required changes in this integrator "
"value to trim the aircraft to a new airspeed. If the TECS.iph value becomes "
"more negative when the demanded airspeed increases, make the "
":ref:`TECS_PTCH_FF_K <TECS_PTCH_FF_K>` more negative. If the TECS.iph value "
"becomes more positive when the demanded aispeed increases, make the "
":ref:`TECS_PTCH_FF_K <TECS_PTCH_FF_K>` value more positive. When this "
"process in complete and the feed-forward gain is providing most of the pitch"
" attitude change needed, the TECS.iph value doesn't need to change much. "
"This gives better tracking of changes in demanded airspeed."
msgstr ""
"要调参此参数，可使用FBWB手动输入速度需求变化，或设置包含DO_CHANGE_SPEED项目的任务。将TECS_PTCH_FF_V0设置为飞机的正常飞行速度。这也应该是飞机在FBWA模式下无俯仰输入时的滑翔速度（即以"
" :ref:`STAB_PITCH_DOWN<STAB_PITCH_DOWN>` "
"参数指定的俯仰姿态飞行时）。查看此类飞行的日志时，查看机载日志中的TECS俯仰积分器项（TECS.iph）。通常，当需求空速增加时，该值会减小（变得更负）以将飞机机头配平向下，反之亦然。目标是使用前馈增益减少配平飞机到新空速所需的积分器值变化量。如果需求空速增加时TECS.iph值变得更负，则将"
" :ref:`TECS_PTCH_FF_K <TECS_PTCH_FF_K>` 设置为更负的值。如果需求空速增加时TECS.iph值变得更正，则将 "
":ref:`TECS_PTCH_FF_K <TECS_PTCH_FF_K>` "
"设置为更正的值。当此过程完成且前馈增益提供大部分所需俯仰姿态变化时，TECS.iph值无需太大变化。这提供了对需求空速变化更好的跟踪。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:300
#: 7f2fe576cb244ab5bc9d4e8f99042243
msgid "Advanced Parameters"
msgstr "高级参数"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:304
#: 3e3e8f5359604b96a8ec5690d3d8c04d
msgid ""
":ref:`TECS_VERT_ACC <TECS_VERT_ACC>`: This is the maximum vertical "
"acceleration either up or down that the controller will use to correct speed"
" or height errors. The default value of 7 m/s/s (equivalent to +- 0.7 g) "
"allows for reasonably aggressive pitch changes if required to recover from "
"under-speed conditions."
msgstr ""
":ref:`TECS_VERT_ACC <TECS_VERT_ACC>`：这是控制器用于纠正速度或高度误差的最大垂直加速度（向上或向下）。默认值7 "
"m/s/s（相当于±0.7g）允许在需要从低速状态恢复时进行相当激进的俯仰变化。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:312
#: bfb533b4101b4d63a5d9a87b897817d2
msgid ""
":ref:`TECS_HGT_OMEGA <TECS_HGT_OMEGA>`: This is the cross-over frequency (in"
" radians/second) of the complementary filter used to fuse vertical "
"acceleration and barometric height to obtain an estimate of height rate and "
"height. Increasing this frequency weights the solution more towards use of "
"the barometer, whilst reducing it weights the solution more towards use of "
"the accelerometer data."
msgstr ""
":ref:`TECS_HGT_OMEGA "
"<TECS_HGT_OMEGA>`：这是用于融合垂直加速度和气压高度以获得高度率和高度估计的互补滤波器的交叉频率（弧度/秒）。增大此频率会使解算更多依赖气压计，减小则更多依赖加速度计数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:322
#: aa7b58ed44d64483ac607c8674313336
msgid ""
":ref:`TECS_SPD_OMEGA <TECS_SPD_OMEGA>`: This is the cross-over frequency (in"
" radians/second)of the complementary filter used to fuse longitudinal "
"acceleration and airspeed to obtain an improved airspeed estimate. "
"Increasing this frequency weights the solution more towards use of the "
"airspeed sensor, whilst reducing it weights the solution more towards use of"
" the accelerometer data."
msgstr ""
":ref:`TECS_SPD_OMEGA "
"<TECS_SPD_OMEGA>`：这是用于融合纵向加速度和空速以获得改进的空速估计的互补滤波器的交叉频率（弧度/秒）。增大此频率会使解算更多依赖空速传感器，减小则更多依赖加速度计数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:331
#: 6b866f671def43cc8e5da5140ff69f41
msgid "Complete Parameter List"
msgstr "完整参数列表"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:335
#: b82062f64436426281243463de477469
msgid ""
":ref:`THR_MAX <THR_MAX>`: This is the maximum throttle % that can be used by"
" the controller. For overpowered aircraft, this should be reduced to a value"
" that provides sufficient thrust to climb at the maximum pitch angle "
":ref:`PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG<PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`THR_MAX <THR_MAX>`：这是控制器可以使用的最大油门百分比。对于功率过剩的飞机，应将其降低到能够在最大俯仰角 "
":ref:`PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG<PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG>` 下提供足够推力爬升的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:342
#: 034402906d8d435189b16f01a3162424
msgid ""
":ref:`THR_MIN <THR_MIN>`: This is the minimum throttle % that can be used by"
" the controller. For electric aircraft this will normally be set to zero, "
"but can be set to a small non-zero value if a folding prop is fitted to "
"prevent the prop from folding and unfolding repeatedly in-flight or to "
"provide some aerodynamic drag from a turning prop to improve the descent "
"rate."
msgstr ""
":ref:`THR_MIN "
"<THR_MIN>`：这是控制器可以使用的最小油门百分比。对于电动飞机，通常设置为零，但如果安装了折叠螺旋桨，可以设置为一个小的非零值，以防止螺旋桨在飞行中反复折叠展开，或者通过旋转螺旋桨提供一定的气动阻力以改善下降率。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:349
#: a614b9bac831463b83e1c1f8b3a5f6ed
msgid ""
":ref:`THR_SLEWRATE <tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-"
"tuning-guide_thr_slewrate>` (definition above)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`THR_SLEWRATE <tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-"
"tuning-guide_thr_slewrate>` （定义见上文）"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:353
#: 9bf87d2db2ee41f481b8803d7f1f7eb9
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
":ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE <TRIM_THROTTLE>`: This is the throttle % required for "
"level flight at the normal cruise speed."
msgstr ":ref:`TRIM_THROTTLE <TRIM_THROTTLE>`：这是正常巡航速度下平飞所需的油门百分比。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:360
#: c79d905fc352489f918b028d817a378c
msgid ""
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MAX <AIRSPEED_MAX>`: This is the maximum airspeed (in "
"metres/second) that the autopilot will use in auto-throttle modes. It should"
" be set to the highest speed that the aircraft can achieve in level flight "
"with the throttle set to :ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>`. It must be sufficiently "
"above the :ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN<AIRSPEED_MIN>` value to allow the autopilot to "
"accurately control altitude using airspeed (at least 50% above "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN<AIRSPEED_MIN>` is recommended). For electric aircraft, "
"make sure this number is achievable at the end of flight when the battery "
"voltage has reduced."
msgstr ""
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MAX <AIRSPEED_MAX>`：这是飞控在自动油门模式下使用的最大空速（米/秒）。应设置为飞机在油门设置为 "
":ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>` 时平飞所能达到的最高速度。必须足够高于 "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN<AIRSPEED_MIN>` 值，以允许飞控使用空速精确控制高度（建议至少高于 "
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN<AIRSPEED_MIN>` 50%）。对于电动飞机，确保此数值在飞行结束时电池电压降低后仍能达到。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:370
#: aadc7e0976c340db893e3b91a1d174d0
msgid ""
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN <AIRSPEED_MIN>`: This is the minimum indicated airspeed "
"(in metres/second) that the speed controller will attempt to control to. "
"This should be set to a speed that allows the aircraft to turn at the "
"maximum bank angle without stalling."
msgstr ""
":ref:`AIRSPEED_MIN "
"<AIRSPEED_MIN>`：这是速度控制器将尝试控制到的最低指示空速（米/秒）。应设置为允许飞机在最大倾斜角转弯时不失速的速度。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:379
#: 781f7504c36340bfa717d804297b34d2
msgid ""
":ref:`TECS_CLMB_MAX <TECS_CLMB_MAX>`: This is the best climb rate (in "
"metres/second) that the aircraft can achieve with the throttle set to "
":ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>` and the airspeed set to the default value. For "
"electric aircraft make sure this number can be achieved towards the end of "
"flight when the battery voltage has reduced. The setting of this parameter "
"can be checked by commanding a positive altitude change of 100m in loiter, "
"RTL or guided mode. If the throttle required to climb is close to "
":ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>` and the aircraft is maintaining airspeed, then this "
"parameter is set correctly. If the airspeed starts to reduce, then the "
"parameter is set to high, and if the throttle demand required to climb and "
"maintain speed is noticeably less than :ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>`, then either "
":ref:`TECS_CLMB_MAX<TECS_CLMB_MAX>` should be increased or "
":ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>` reduced."
msgstr ""
":ref:`TECS_CLMB_MAX <TECS_CLMB_MAX>`：这是飞机在油门设置为 :ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>` "
"且空速设置为默认值时能达到的最佳爬升率（米/秒）。对于电动飞机，确保此数值在飞行结束时电池电压降低后仍能达到。可以通过在Loiter、RTL或Guided模式下指令100米正高度变化来检查此参数设置。如果爬升所需油门接近"
" :ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>` 且飞机保持空速，则此参数设置正确。如果空速开始下降，则参数设置过高；如果爬升并保持速度所需油门明显低于"
" :ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>`，则应增大 :ref:`TECS_CLMB_MAX<TECS_CLMB_MAX>` 或减小 "
":ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:396
#: 380fd2d364a64901b2f3c9a70c584c74
msgid ""
":ref:`TECS_SINK_MIN <TECS_SINK_MIN>`: This is the sink rate of the aircraft "
"(in metres/second) with the throttle set to :ref:`THR_MIN<THR_MIN>` and "
"flown at the same airspeed as used to measure :ref:`TECS_CLMB_MAX`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`TECS_SINK_MIN <TECS_SINK_MIN>`：这是飞机在油门设置为 :ref:`THR_MIN<THR_MIN>` 并以测量"
" :ref:`TECS_CLMB_MAX` 时相同的空速飞行时的下沉率（米/秒）。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:404
#: 5905793313234a99924127618679a6c6
msgid ""
":ref:`TECS_TIME_CONST <TECS_TIME_CONST>`: This is the time constant of the "
"TECS control algorithm (in seconds). Smaller values make it faster to "
"respond, larger values make it slower to respond."
msgstr ""
":ref:`TECS_TIME_CONST <TECS_TIME_CONST>`：这是TECS控制算法的时间常数（秒）。值越小响应越快，值越大响应越慢。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:408
#: 2cb7be3484074f3f8b026a6a840132a4
msgid ""
":ref:`TECS_THR_DAMP <tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-"
"tuning-guide_tecs_thr_damp>` (definition above)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`TECS_THR_DAMP <tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-"
"tuning-guide_tecs_thr_damp>` （定义见上文）"

