#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:421
#: 9656b7b8bdbf4962b52cb6ebe933d83f
msgid ""
":ref:`PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG <PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG>`: This is the maximum pitch angle "
"(in degrees) that the controller will demand. It should be set to a value "
"that the aircraft can achieve whilst maintaining airspeed with the throttle "
"set to :ref:`THR_MAX`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG <PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG>`：这是控制器将要求的最大俯仰角（度）。应设置为飞机在油门设置为 "
":ref:`THR_MAX` 时能够保持空速的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide.rst:429
#: e2416d5b18ae4b58838c0d68e1533e6d
msgid ""
":ref:`PTCH_LIM_MIN_DEG <PTCH_LIM_MIN_DEG>`: This is the minimum pitch angle "
"(in degrees) that the controller will demand. It should be set to a value "
"that the aircraft can achieve without over-speeding with the throttle set to"
" :ref:`THR_MIN<THR_MIN>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`PTCH_LIM_MIN_DEG <PTCH_LIM_MIN_DEG>`：这是控制器将要求的最小俯仰角（度）。应设置为飞机在油门设置为 "
":ref:`THR_MIN<THR_MIN>` 时能够不超速的值。"

